# Copy to .env.local for local dev (.env*.local is gitignored — never commit keys).
#
# Madame Zara (the fortune-teller attraction, /api/fortune):
# - Without a key the route streams a canned in-character reading (stub mode).
# - Production: set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in Vercel project settings (server-side
#   only — it must never be exposed to the client bundle).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Force stub mode even with a key present (dev / headless verification).
FORTUNE_STUB=
